  "description": "A Media over QUIC Transport (MOQT) implementation for .NET, pinned to draft-ietf-moq-transport-18: the wire codec (MoQ variable-length integers, Key-Value-Pairs, control-message framing), the control messages, the subgroup object data plane with Extension Headers, FETCH, and the session handshake — plus publisher/subscriber facades over it. It runs on a small QUIC seam (Spangle.Net.Transport.Quic) so the protocol is exercised over an in-memory backend where msquic is unavailable, and over real msquic in CI. Media mapping (LOC, CMSF, catalogs) is deliberately left to the consumer. Pre-1.0; interfaces may change.",
